### 登录接口测试
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 或 IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client 测试

### 测试1: 正常登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 测试2: 错误密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 测试3: 不存在的用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "notexist",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 测试4: 空用户名
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "admin123"
}

